{"t":"AOS","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"A. O. Smith Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","employees":11500,"hq":"Milwaukee, WI, United States","website":"https://www.aosmith.com","summary_en":"A. O. Smith Corporation manufactures and markets residential and commercial gas and electric water heaters, boilers, heat pumps, tanks, and water treatment products in North America, China, Europe, and India. The company offers water heaters for residences, restaurants, hotels, office buildings, laundries, car washes, and small businesses; boilers for hospitals, schools, hotels, homes, apartments, and condominiums, and other large commercial buildings; and water treatment products comprising point-of-entry water softeners, well water solutions, and whole-home water filtration products, and point-of-use carbon and reverse osmosis products for residences, restaurants, hotels, and offices. It also provides commercial water treatment and filtration products; expansion tanks, commercial solar water heating systems, swimming pool and spa heaters, and related products and parts; and electric wall-hung, gas tankless, combi-boiler, and heat pump and solar water heaters. The company offers its products under the A. O. Smith, State, Lochinvar, Hague, Water-Right, Master Water, Atlantic Filter, Impact, and Water Tec brands. It distributes its products through independent wholesale plumbing distributors, as well as to retail channels consisting of hardware and home center chains, and manufacturer representative firms, as well as offers Aquasana branded products directly to consumers through e-commerce channels; and A. O. Smith branded water treatment products through dealer network and Amazon. A. O. Smith Corporation was founded in 1874 and is headquartered in Milwaukee, Wisconsin.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"A. O. Smith Corporation은 북미, 중국, 유럽 및 인도에서 주거용 및 상업용 가스 및 전기 온수기, 보일러, 열 펌프, 탱크 및 수처리 제품을 제조 및 판매합니다. 이 회사는 주거용, 레스토랑, 호텔, 사무실 건물, 세탁소, 세차장 및 소규모 기업에 온수기를 제공합니다. 병원, 학교, 호텔, 주택, 아파트, 콘도, 기타 대형 상업용 건물의 보일러; 진입점 연수기, 우물물 솔루션, 집 전체 정수 여과 제품으로 구성된 수처리 제품, 주거용, 레스토랑, 호텔, 사무실용 사용 시점 탄소 및 역삼투 제품 등이 있습니다. 또한 상업용 수처리 및 여과 제품도 제공합니다. 팽창 탱크, 상업용 태양열 온수기 시스템, 수영장 및 스파 히터, 관련 제품 및 부품; 전기 벽걸이형, 가스탱크리스형, 콤비보일러, 히트펌프, 태양열 온수기 등이 있습니다. 이 회사는 A. O. Smith, State, Lochinvar, Hague, Water-Right, Master Water, Atlantic Filter, Impact 및 Water Tec 브랜드로 제품을 제공합니다. 독립적인 도매 배관 유통업체는 물론 하드웨어 및 홈센터 체인, 제조업체 대표 기업으로 구성된 소매 채널을 통해 제품을 유통할 뿐만 아니라 전자상거래 채널을 통해 Aquasana 브랜드 제품을 소비자에게 직접 제공합니다. 그리고 A.O. Smith는 딜러 네트워크와 Amazon을 통해 수처리 제품을 브랜드화했습니다. A. O. Smith Corporation은 1874년에 설립되었으며 위스콘신 주 밀워키에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":66.57,"mcap":8942278656.0,"pe":18.752113,"fpe":17.596075,"peg":1.8071,"ps":2.3514366,"pb":4.9049516,"ev_ebitda":11.993,"div":2.27,"beta":1.037,"hi52":81.87,"lo52":54.16},"fin":{"rev":3802899968.0,"rev_g":-0.002,"eps_g":-0.011,"gross":0.38618,"op":0.18628,"net":0.13006,"roe":0.26971,"fcf":430500000.0,"cash":234500000.0,"debt":715000000.0,"de":39.219,"eps":3.55,"feps":3.78323},"own":{"short":0.11229999,"inst":1.19428,"insider":0.0046900003},"analyst":{"n":10,"mean":66.5,"median":67.0,"high":72.0,"low":58.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.84615,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":1,"buy":2,"hold":8,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":1,"buy":2,"hold":8,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":1,"buy":4,"hold":6,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":1,"buy":4,"hold":6,"sell":1,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":67.0,"priorPriceTarget":64.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"Oppenheimer","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":72.0,"priorPriceTarget":75.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-19","Firm":"Stifel","ToGrad